rary assignment sets","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:256460aa1592a1bf36223a50416199f2f91b6ff1acfe5cb719427fc9de25cefc","file":"preprints/Variance-of-the-Random-k-SAT-Hitting-Time-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/replacement-sharpness.tex","line":129,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"ac7f8609964c42cbbe347d1271e8f89183c99b2a1cdb79542b240b7a9e2a18ef","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Variance-of-the-Random-k-SAT-Hitting-Time-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/replacement-sharpness.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:256460aa1592a1bf36223a50416199f2f91b6ff1acfe5cb719427fc9de25cefc","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Variance-of-the-Random-k-SAT-Hitting-Time-September-27-2026/build/source/sections/replacement-sharpness.tex#L129"},"statement_kind":"proposition","text":"\\label{prop:replacement-sharp}\nFix an integer \\(k\\ge3\\).  For integers \\(g\\ge2\\), there are nonempty\nsets \\(S_g\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{u_g}\\), with \\(u_g\\ge k\\), for which\n\\[\n q_1(S_g)-R_g(S_g)\\sim 2^{-k}g^{-(k-1)}\n \\qquad(g\\to\\infty).\n\\]\nIn particular, no error \\(o(g^{-(k-1)})\\), uniform over \\(u\\) and the\nassignment set, can replace the error in\nLemma~\\ref{lem:one-replacement}."}
